{"id":"n1-043","title":"Noun とは比べものにならない","romaji":"~to wa kurabemono ni naranai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Indicates something is not comparable; 'beyond comparison'.","longExplanation":"Use とは比べものにならない to emphasize that two things differ so greatly they cannot be compared—one is vastly superior or different in scale, quality, etc.","formation":"Noun + とは比べものにならない","examples":[{"jp":"新しい車の速さは古い車とは比べものにならない。","romaji":"Atarashii kuruma no hayasa wa furui kuruma to wa kurabemono ni naranai.","en":"The speed of the new car is not comparable to the old one.","words":[{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"車","vocabId":"1323080","reading":"くるま"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"速","vocabId":"2093400","reading":"そく","baseForm":"速い"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"古い","vocabId":"1265070","reading":"ふるい"},{"surface":"車","vocabId":"1323080","reading":"くるま"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"比べもの","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なら","vocabId":"2827768","reading":"なら","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8,9,10,11,12,13]},{"jp":"彼の英語のうまさは私とは比べものにならない。","romaji":"Kare no eigo no umasa wa watashi to wa kurabemono ni naranai.","en":"His English skills are beyond comparison with mine.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"英語","vocabId":"1174420","reading":"えいご"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"うま","vocabId":"1471560","reading":"うま","baseForm":"うまい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"比べもの","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なら","vocabId":"2827768","reading":"なら","baseForm":"